* Unified board power path (templates page 8). Values come from sim/parameters.csv and
* shield_deck/parameters.csv through params.inc; run_sim.py sets the case parameters
* (TRAMP, TPLUG, TLED, DUTY, TSHORT, RSHORT) and the outputs.
.include params.inc
* splitter: ramped source, current limit (ILIM pushed into the output, the excess returned through a
* near-ideal diode), output resistance, output capacitance
Vsp sp0 0 PWL(0 0 {TRAMP} {SPLIT_V})
Ilim sp0 sp1 {SPLIT_ILIM}
Dlim sp1 sp0 dideal
.model dideal d is=1e-14 n=0.05 rs=1e-4
Rsp sp1 sp1b {SPLIT_ROUT}
Vsens sp1b sp 0
Csp sp spc {SPLIT_C}
Resp spc 0 {SPLIT_ESR}
* USB-C cord, with a switch that closes at TPLUG (hot plug)
Sw sp cab0 ctl 0 swmod
Vcabs cab0 cab1 0
Vctl ctl 0 PWL(0 0 {TPLUG} 0 {TPLUG+1n} 1)
.model swmod sw vt=0.5 vh=0.01 ron=1m roff=1e9
Lcab cab1 cab2 {CORD_L}
Rcab cab2 sock {CORD_R}
* socket pigtail into strip A
Lsock sock sk2 {PIGTAIL_L}
Rsock sk2 vin {PIGTAIL_R}
* C1
Rc1 vin c1a {C1_ESR}
Lc1 c1a c1b {C1_ESL}
C1 c1b 0 {LED_CAP}
* ESP32 through the plug pigtail
Lplug vin pl2 {PIGTAIL_L}
Rplug pl2 esp {PIGTAIL_R}
Cesp esp 0 {ESP_C}
Iesp esp 0 PWL(0 0 2m 0 2.5m {ESP_A})
* three XIAOs, lumped
Rhar vin xi {HARNESS_R}
Cxi xi 0 {3*XIAO_C}
Ixi xi 0 PWL(0 0 2m 0 2.5m {3*XIAO_A})
* U1 supply and C3
Ru1 vin u1 0.01
C3 u1 0 {U1_C}
* fuse, fused rail, C2
Vfuse vin f1 0
Rfuse f1 vled {FUSE_R}
Lfuse vled vled2 {FUSE_L}
C2 vled2 0 {LED_BYPASS}
* strip feed and the strip's own decoupling
Lstrip vled2 st1 {STRIP_FEED_L}
Rstrip st1 strip {STRIP_FEED_R}
Cpix strip 0 {LED_PIXELS*PIXEL_C}
* strip load: dark current always, lit current in PWM pulses from TLED
Iidle strip 0 {ILED_DARK}
Bled strip 0 I='(time > {TLED}) ? ({ILED_WHITE}-{ILED_DARK}) * ((1/{PIXEL_PWM_HZ})*{DUTY} > (time - floor(time*{PIXEL_PWM_HZ})/{PIXEL_PWM_HZ}) ? 1 : 0) : 0'
* fault: short at the strip end from TSHORT
Ssh strip shn sctl 0 swmod
Vsctl sctl 0 PWL(0 0 {TSHORT} 0 {TSHORT+1n} 1)
Rsh shn 0 {RSHORT}
.end
